from pathlib import Path
import json
R=Path('/workspace/work/rebuild')
LANG={
'tide-tab':('05/06/08','Attached tabs235×52 on779×209 panels, with a square upper-left body corner and21px remaining corners. The smaller tab radius is16px. A271px circular core has a12px rim, and its three243×252 spokes are joined by an8px rounded U. Display headings are64px heavy, panel names30px and notes16.1px at1.3 leading. Tiny tracked captions sit below the page titles. Page08 supplies the centred18.67px/1.28 running paragraphs, blue bold ranges and teal inline highlight, with23–24px paragraph spacing. Floating faces use n1, the first and second ranked accents identify tabs, and page paper uses the two palest soft roles.'),
'cutfield':('05/10/11','Lower-right28px chamfers define fields and phase cards.54px figures are light, with18px/650 names and16px body at1.45 leading, while the very large page titles are light at350 weight. Fine1–1.5px strokes make rising diagonal arrows and straight timelines. The page owns its deep accent scene; faces are independently page/neutral/primary/secondary roles. The geometry is flat, sharp and open, without shadows or generic rounded enclosures.'),
'filament':('03/06/07','Light editorial type,1px rounded outlines and12px corners contrast with large uninterrupted page space. Italic13px credit lines and fine curved ornaments are secondary devices. Body paragraphs occupy narrow measured columns, and the service rows keep their original line rhythm. The page, deep accent text and accent fill/on pair are separate roles. Oversize display titles and curved text seals that the contract cannot carry are recorded as gaps.'),
'portico':('08/11/13','Rectangular ruled panels, a155px heading band and an88px outer rail establish the page. Montserrat54px heavy headings use open tracking, with16px business body and20–23px local names. The172px allocation rings retain a136px hole,40px main figure and16px unit. Timeline phases rise by52px beneath54px header strips. Sand roles stay neutral; navy source material becomes the first accent, with its deep text counterpart and contrast on-colour. No shadow or casual pill is added to ruled information faces.'),
'toggle-grid':('06/09/12','Strong horizontal heading and footer bands, a369px reading sidebar and a68px outer gutter organise the page.1px grid rules are exposed. Rounded capsules and circular carriers supply the only broad curves, with one ranked accent carrying the point. The source Oswald heading is approximated with the allowed Noto Sans variable width axis at 75%, without scaling or font aliasing; the remaining glyph-height difference is declared as a font gap. Do Hyeon supplies the rounded display voice, and business body stays Pretendard. Tables have a measured quarter-width label column, and the hub uses a134px core with169×44px capsules. There are no soft shadows.'),
'lamella':('03/10/11/19','An asymmetric leaf cap—217×30 with rounded upper-right and lower-left ends—sits beside a1px vertical hairline. Column notes use15px internal subheads and11px/16px detail. Main page titles are nominally44px light; thin plot strokes,6px points and transparent areas belong to their chart roots. The nested market diagram has quarter-disc radii665/451/246, while the roadmap retains21px duration strips on104px lanes. Accent, soft ranked fills, page paper and independent light faces are fixed roles across the deck.'),
'rulemark':('01/05/09/11','Straight1px rules, rectangular light fields and dense ink headings form the material.41–46px circular chevrons direct reading. Page titles are48px heavy, and the cover contrasts two88px lines. Table rows and header are57px; large circles and repeated step chevrons are joined by their own common element. Alternating timelines use308×114px faces,56px stems and14px dots. Labels remain plain except the measured127×36px page capsules. Grayscale positions, rather than a new decorative accent, carry the hierarchy.')}
for n,(pages,language)in LANG.items():
 C=R/n/n;V=R/n/'review';(C/'kit/description.md').write_text(language+' The individual source-backed elements are measured independently; absent contracts are inferred only after those elements, without reusing a previous kit stylesheet.\n')
 m=json.loads((V/'map.json').read_text());roles=m['roles'];text='# Design language\n\n'+language+'\n\nSource grammar pages: '+pages+'.\n\n'+ '\n'.join('- '+k+' = `'+v+'`'for k,v in roles.items())+'\n\nSource-specific unsupported structures are listed only in GAPS.md. Generic elements are explicitly labelled inferred in their descriptions.\n'
 (V/'design-language.md').write_text(text)
print('Seven source-grounded kit descriptions and role documents written')
